# `pipelines.list_runs`

All runs, each with its step rows.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.pipelines.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`ListPipelineRunsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `runs` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call pipelines.list_runs --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "runs": [
    {
      "run": {
        "pipeline_run_id": "job-checkout-flow-a1b2c3d",
        "slug": "checkout-flow-a1b2c3d",
        "status": "completed",
        "started_at": "2026-05-24T18:00:00Z",
        "ended_at": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z",
        "outcome": "completed"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "step_id": "implement",
          "status": "completed",
          "started_at": "2026-05-24T18:00:00Z",
          "completed_at": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z",
          "depends_on": [],
          "step_type": "agent",
          "attempt": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
